inst/extdata/cmsy_priors.csv
  Resilience and prior r values taken from FishBase (Froese R, Pauly D, Eds.) and SeaLifeBase
  (Palomares MLD, Pauly D, Eds.), release 26.06, through the parquet snapshots published by the
  rfishbase project (https://data.source.coop/cboettig/fishbase/). Each row links to the
  FishBase or SeaLifeBase page it comes from. Licence: Creative Commons
  Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0), FishBase.org team, as stated for
  the snapshots; no commercial use. Rebuilt by data-raw/cmsy_priors.R.

inst/extdata/fishbase_traits.rda
  Trophic level, preferred temperature, habitat, maximum length and vulnerability of the FAO
  species items, taken from FishBase (Froese R, Pauly D, Eds.) and SeaLifeBase (Palomares MLD,
  Pauly D, Eds.), release 26.06, through the parquet snapshots published by the rfishbase project
  (https://data.source.coop/cboettig/fishbase/), and matched by the rules listed by
  fishbase_sources(). Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
  (CC BY-NC 4.0), FishBase.org team, as stated for the snapshots; no commercial use.
  Valid names looked up in the World Register of Marine Species (WoRMS Editorial Board,
  https://www.marinespecies.org, doi:10.14284/170), licence CC BY.
  Each row links to the FishBase, SeaLifeBase or WoRMS page it comes from.
  Rebuilt by data-raw/build_fishbase_traits.R.

  The same CC BY-NC 4.0 licence applies to the FishBase and SeaLifeBase tables that
  download_fishbase_data() and fishbase_table() download.
